A floating attribute is scoped to the container that holds it

```
> q
> {.k}

tail
.
<blockquote><p>q
{.k}</p></blockquote>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
> q
> {.k}
tail
.
<blockquote><p>q
{.k}
tail</p></blockquote>
```

```
- a
  {.k}

tail
.
<ul>
  <li>a
{.k}</li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- a
  {.k}
# H
.
<ul>
  <li>a
{.k}
# H</li>
</ul>
```

```
:: t
:  d
   {.k}
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>d
{.k}</dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
:: t
:  d
   {.k
   #x}
tail
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>d
{.k
<span class="tag"><strong>#x</strong></span>}</dd>
</dl>
<p>tail</p>
```

